cardputer-plaits

This repository contains two kinds of code:

1. lib/mutable/src - Mutable Instruments Plaits and stmlib, written by
   Emilie Gillet, copyright 2012-2021 Emilie Gillet, MIT licence.
   See lib/mutable/LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

2. Everything else (src/, host_test/, build files, docs) - written for this
   project and released under the MIT licence below.

